/*QUAKED    coop_weld_weld    (0.5 0.25 0.25)    (0 0 0)    (0 0 0)
Coop Mod WeldPoint - Used for setting up weld points.
Example level: coop_test-welding

1. Place one or max of 20 at each door you want to weld.
- All the WeldPoints for one door will group together
- All the WeldPoint for one door need the same targetname

2. Give a uniqe targetname to the door and the WeldPoint group
- Example: Door: door1, WeldPoint: door1_weld

3. In the level script include the weld script:
- #include "co-op/matrix/weld.script"

4. In the level script run setup in main like this
- thread weld_setupDoor($door1,$door1_weld,"welded","Technician",1);
- thread weld_setupDoor($door2,$door2_weld,"normal","",0);

Parameters:
$door1 -> The door destined for welding
$door1_weld -> The WeldPoint group
"welded" -> If you want the door welded at start, if not use "normal"
"Technician" -> Class that should exclusively allowed to weld this, use "" for everyone
1 -> 1 allowes infinate welding, 0 allowes welding or unwelding just once


*/